{"seq":3,"slug":"bundle-attach-rate-metric","title":"Bundle 附加率与组合效果度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-merchandising/bundle-attach-rate-metric","wordCount":2011,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"bundle-附加率与组合效果度量\">Bundle 附加率与组合效果度量</h1><p>最后一个问题也最难回答：这些组合策略到底有没有用。难的地方不在于算不出数字，而在于多数团队用的数字是错的——「组合带来的 GMV」几乎总是高估，因为它把「买家本来就会买」的那部分也算成了组合的功劳。学术界对搭配推荐的效果度量也有同类关切：以流行度偏差为切入点的工作主张在推荐与评估中剥离「本来就会热销」的成分，让效果归因于真实增量而非既有偏好（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.19107\">Headache to Overstock? Promoting Long-tail Items through Debiased Product Bundling, arXiv:2411.19107</a>）。要得到诚实的结论，必须把增量从存量里剥离出来。本篇给出三个指标的定义、一组可落地的计算口径，以及为什么不能只看 GMV。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>附加率 attach rate</td>\n<td>购买主品的订单中同时包含推荐件的比例</td>\n<td>推荐位有没有被看到并接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合渗透率 bundle penetration</td>\n<td>含组合行的订单占全部订单的比例</td>\n<td>组合这种售卖形态的覆盖面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蚕食率 cannibalization</td>\n<td>组合成交中「本会单独购买」的占比</td>\n<td>组合是否只是把存量挪了位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量附加率 incremental attach</td>\n<td>附加率减去基线共同购买率</td>\n<td>推荐真正带来的增量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[全部订单] --&gt; B[含组合行的订单]&#10;  B --&gt; C[组合成交额]&#10;  C --&gt; D[基线共同购买率对照]&#10;  D --&gt; E{成交是否超出基线}&#10;  E --&gt;|超出| F[计为增量, 计入附加率分子]&#10;  E --&gt;|未超出| G[计为蚕食, 从效果中剔除]&#10;  F --&gt; H[增量附加率]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[全部订单] --&gt; B[含组合行的订单]\n  B --&gt; C[组合成交额]\n  C --&gt; D[基线共同购买率对照]\n  D --&gt; E{成交是否超出基线}\n  E --&gt;|超出| F[计为增量, 计入附加率分子]\n  E --&gt;|未超出| G[计为蚕食, 从效果中剔除]\n  F --&gt; H[增量附加率]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h3 id=\"附加率的正确分母\">附加率的正确分母</h3><p>附加率最常错在分母。用「所有访问者的推荐点击率」是渠道指标，不是附加率；用「所有订单」会稀释掉主品订单的范围。恰当的分母是<strong>含主品的订单</strong>，分子是其中同时含推荐件的订单：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>attach</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>订单含主品</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>含推荐件</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>订单含主品</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{attach} = \\frac{\\#(\\text{订单含主品} \\wedge \\text{含推荐件})}{\\#(\\text{订单含主品})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单含主品</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单含主品</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">含推荐件</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"基线-为什么必须有对照组\">基线：为什么必须有对照组</h3><p>只算附加率会得到无意义的高分——很多商品本来就经常被一起买（如相机与存储卡），附加率天然很高，与有没有推荐位无关。因此必须引入<strong>基线共同购买率</strong>作为对照：取推荐位上线的历史同期数据，或取未被推荐位曝光的用户群，计算同组合的自然共同购买比例。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>incremental attach</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>attach</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>attach</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{incremental attach} = \\text{attach}_{treatment} - \\text{attach}_{baseline}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">incremental attach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attach</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attach</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有在 treatment 与 baseline 的样本可比时这个差值才有意义。若上线推荐位的同时还做了降价，附加率的提升里混着价格效应，此时应当用随机分流实验而非历史对照。度量基础设施本身属于实验平台范畴，本 hub 只约定组合场景下必须做基线剥离这一原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蚕食的度量与判据\">蚕食的度量与判据</h2><p>蚕食指的是组合成交中「买家本来会分别购买这两件」的部分。它的直接后果是毛利下降：两笔单变成一笔单，且这一笔单还带了折扣。</p>\n<p>判据有三条，任一条成立即计入蚕食：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>组件单独购买率在使用组合后显著下降</strong>，且下降幅度与组合成交量相当。</li>\n<li><strong>组合成交的用户与组件单买用户的画像高度重合</strong>（老客、已购用户）。</li>\n<li><strong>A/B 实验中，组合曝光组的整体毛利低于对照组的整体毛利</strong>（这是最直接的判据）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 3 条是唯一不需要假设的判据，也是唯一能真正裁决蚕食的。前两条只能提示怀疑，不能定性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"蚕食不总是坏事\">蚕食不总是坏事</h3><p>需要澄清一点：蚕食并非在所有场景下都应当被抑制。当组合的作用是<strong>抢占竞品份额</strong>或<strong>提升复购频次</strong>时，牺牲单件毛利换取整体份额是合理策略。工程上要做的是把蚕食<strong>度量出来并显式记录</strong>，让决策者看到真实的账，而不是在指标上把它藏掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算口径的工程落地\">计算口径的工程落地</h2><p>度量依赖三张表：组合成交明细、组件单卖明细、以及每笔订单是否曝光过推荐位。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 增量附加率：treatment 与 baseline 分列对照&#10;WITH treated AS (&#10;  SELECT o.order_id,&#10;         MAX(CASE WHEN l.component_sku = :recommendSku THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_rec&#10;  FROM orders o&#10;  JOIN order_line_allocation l ON l.order_id = o.order_id&#10;  WHERE o.created_at BETWEEN :t0 AND :t1&#10;    AND o.exposed_recommendation = TRUE&#10;  GROUP BY o.order_id&#10;), baseline AS (&#10;  SELECT o.order_id,&#10;         MAX(CASE WHEN l.component_sku = :recommendSku THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_rec&#10;  FROM orders o&#10;  JOIN order_line_allocation l ON l.order_id = o.order_id&#10;  WHERE o.created_at BETWEEN :t0 AND :t1&#10;    AND o.exposed_recommendation = FALSE&#10;  GROUP BY o.order_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT AVG(has_rec) FILTER (WHERE TRUE) AS treated_attach,&#10;       (SELECT AVG(has_rec) FROM baseline) AS baseline_attach&#10;FROM treated;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 增量附加率：treatment 与 baseline 分列对照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">component_sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :recommendSku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_rec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_line_allocation l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :t0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :t1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposed_recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), baseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">component_sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :recommendSku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_rec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_line_allocation l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :t0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :t1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exposed_recommendation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(has_rec) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treated_attach,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(has_rec) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_attach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> treated;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里用的是 <code>order_line_allocation</code> 而不是订单行本身——组合的组件只有在分摊表里才是可寻址的，这与 <a href=\"bundle-return-component-recovery\">Bundle 退货按组件回收与退款分摊</a> 依赖同一张表。<strong>分摊表同时是退款与度量的基础数据</strong>，这一点值得在数据治理上单独标注。</p>\n<h3 id=\"曝光标记的埋点要求\">曝光标记的埋点要求</h3><p><code>exposed_recommendation</code> 这类字段看似简单，却是整条度量链路的前提。它必须在<strong>推荐位实际渲染</strong>时写入，而不是在推荐服务返回结果时写入——否则返回了但没渲染的推荐也计入曝光，会让附加率被系统性低估。埋点位置错误是度量失真的首要原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不看-gmv\">为什么不看 GMV</h2><p>用「组合成交 GMV」作为效果指标有三个具体缺陷：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重复计入已计入的单</strong>：组合的成交额里包含了组件本来会卖出的部分，(Sum of 组合 GMV) 与「整体 GMV」不是增量关系。</li>\n<li><strong>与折扣深度正相关</strong>：折扣越深的组合成交额越高，但毛利可能越低。GMV 上升与经营变好之间没有必然联系。</li>\n<li><strong>激励错配</strong>：以 GMV 为考核会让运营倾向于把热销件组进组合（成交额高），正是 <a href=\"../bundle-inventory-price/bundle-margin-clearance-goal\">Bundle 毛利与清库存/搭售目标</a> 中警告的反面。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>替代指标应当是<strong>增量贡献毛利</strong>：即本 hub 毛利篇定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CM</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CM}_{bundle}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中超出基线的那部分。它同时惩罚蚕食与过度让利，是唯一与经营目标同向的度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量口径的常见错误\">度量口径的常见错误</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>修法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用所有订单做附加率分母</td>\n<td>指标被稀释到无意义</td>\n<td>分母改为含主品的订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无基线对照</td>\n<td>附加率虚高，与推荐无关</td>\n<td>引入基线共同购买率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光在服务返回时埋点</td>\n<td>附加率被系统性低估</td>\n<td>改为渲染时埋点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用组合 GMV 做效果指标</td>\n<td>折扣越深指标越好</td>\n<td>改用增量贡献毛利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>treatment 与 baseline 不同期</td>\n<td>混入价格与季节效应</td>\n<td>用随机分流实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用订单行而非分摊表取组件</td>\n<td>组件不可寻址，统计漏数</td>\n<td>统一走 <code>order_line_allocation</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标的下游使用\">指标的下游使用</h2><p>度量结果需要回流到具体的设计参数，而不是停留在看板。三条可操作的映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测</th>\n<th>指向的设计参数</th>\n<th>调整方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增量附加率显著为正但毛利为负</td>\n<td>折扣深度</td>\n<td>抬高 <code>margin_floor</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蚕食率超过上限</td>\n<td>选品</td>\n<td>替换组合中的热销件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加率低于基线</td>\n<td>推荐位或呈现</td>\n<td>检查曝光埋点与推荐接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三条映射让度量成为闭环的一部分，而不是事后汇报——这正是本 hub 从建模、库存定价、履约到度量的最后一段，度量的结论会回头修正前面各篇的参数假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>附加率的分母是含主品的订单；蚕食率必须有基线对照才有意义。</li>\n<li>增量附加率 = 附加率 − 基线共同购买率，基线须与 treatment 样本可比。</li>\n<li>蚕食的最终判据是 A/B 实验中组合曝光组整体毛利低于对照组，前两条只能提示怀疑。</li>\n<li>蚕食不总是坏事，但必须被度量并显式记录，不能藏进指标。</li>\n<li>度量与退款共享同一张分摊表，曝光埋点必须在渲染时写入。</li>\n<li>不要用组合 GMV 作为效果指标，用增量贡献毛利。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此本 hub 的四条主线闭合：建模决定身份，库存与定价决定可卖性，履约决定交付，度量回过头检验前三者的假设是否成立。若度量发现增量贡献毛利为负，通常要回到 <a href=\"../bundle-model/virtual-kit-vs-physical-assembly\">虚拟组合商品与实体组装套装</a> 重新审视组合的身份与目标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Bundle 附加率与组合效果度量","id":"bundle-附加率与组合效果度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"附加率的正确分母","id":"附加率的正确分母"},{"level":3,"text":"基线：为什么必须有对照组","id":"基线-为什么必须有对照组"},{"level":2,"text":"蚕食的度量与判据","id":"蚕食的度量与判据"},{"level":3,"text":"蚕食不总是坏事","id":"蚕食不总是坏事"},{"level":2,"text":"计算口径的工程落地","id":"计算口径的工程落地"},{"level":3,"text":"曝光标记的埋点要求","id":"曝光标记的埋点要求"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不看 GMV","id":"为什么不看-gmv"},{"level":2,"text":"度量口径的常见错误","id":"度量口径的常见错误"},{"level":2,"text":"指标的下游使用","id":"指标的下游使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Bundle 退货按组件回收与退款分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dynamic-bundle-kit-commerce/bundle-merchandising/bundle-return-component-recovery"},"next":null}